      "kind": "positive",
      "assertion": "Distribution candidate определяет canonical ALT Linux 10.1 ZIP с packaged config, VERSION, install/uninstall scripts и systemd lifecycle; distro-owned runtime dependencies могут приходить через apt-rpm.",
